{"version":1,"content":"<p>英特爾Bartlett Lake-S處理器據稱可在MSI Z690和Z790主板原生啓動。此前測試者需要修改BIOS才能讓這類純性能核處理器運行，但最新報告顯示，只需更新MSI最新BIOS，部分主板即可直接支持該系列處理器。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587654.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T12:23:51.502629+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":117,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T12:08:57+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T12:17:11.348703+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T12:17:11.348703+00:00","content_hash":"06830a910e6eb61e33735981945df919565c5fba26aaef20120ae300dec8e24f","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}